This fragment is CSS for a page containing an h1 and button. Put it in the page's CSS editor or a stylesheet connected to that page.

```css
body {
  background: #fff8ed;
  color: #243647;
  font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;
}
h1 {
  color: #243647;
  margin-top: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
button {
  padding: 12px 18px;
  margin: 6px;
}
